 "_comment": [
  "NitroFusion2 (2 steps) - Text to Image. Export (API) format for a bitGen Studio image style.",
  "2.729.0 (Tim: \"can u add this please https://chendaryen.github.io/NitroFusion2.github.io/\"). NitroFusion2 (Dar-Yen Chen, Yi-Zhe Song,",
  "Apache-2.0) is Z-Image-Turbo distilled to 1-2 steps with an adversarial loss on the MMDiT's text stream - sharp text and fine detail in one step.",
  "Derived from the authors' workflows/nitrofusion2_2step.json: the first step with their de-distillation LoRA at 0.5 (it takes",
  "NitroFusion2 back towards Z-Image-Turbo and removes some artifacts), the second step NitroFusion2 alone - two KSamplerAdvanced on one",
  "2-step schedule (0 -> 1, 1 -> 2), shift 6. Their LoRA-at-0.0 node on the second step is left out (a LoRA at 0 is the model itself).",
  "MODELS: as the 1-step style + models/loras/nf2-dedistill-lora.safetensors (382 MB). The de-distillation LoRA's node is \"(fixed)\":",
  "a style's own LoRAs go in the 4 slots before it, never into it. 2 steps, cfg 1, euler / simple, 1024 x 1024."
 ],
